  "output": "I’ll write the script with explicit transaction control, creating the savepoint before the changes and committing atomically.Created `adjust_inventory.py:1`.\n\n- Opens `inventory.db` and starts an explicit transaction.\n- Creates the `before_gadget` savepoint.\n- Updates Widget to quantity 8 and inserts Doodad with quantity 3.\n- Releases the savepoint and commits atomically.\n- Ran the script and verified all four products.",
